  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466474",
      "title": "Data Binding & Event Binding",
      "lectureOrder": 642,
      "videoOrder": 591,
      "sourceHash": "2530125fb1d8681ea7b00726db0ae01eaf609f36a70c119ea6a8cba321f6e487",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.49,
          "end": 4.17,
          "en": "Instructor: Of course, we see no message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.17,
          "end": 6.9,
          "en": "And of course, we can't dismiss it by clicking,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.9,
          "end": 10.68,
          "en": "because in our Alert Component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.68,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "we do have @Input and @Output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 16.38,
          "en": "but we're not using property or event biding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.38,
          "end": 18.24,
          "en": "on our component at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.24,
          "end": 20.19,
          "en": "because we created it here in code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 21.84,
          "en": "We can't use the square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.84,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "or the parenthesis syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 27.15,
          "en": "So how can we now pass data into that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.15,
          "end": 30.273,
          "en": "or listen to an event or remove that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 35.76,
          "en": "Well, we simply have to store the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.76,
          "end": 39.87,
          "en": "that is created here in some constant or variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 41.88,
          "en": "with which we can work thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.88,
          "end": 43.71,
          "en": "So here, I will store my component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "however it's just a reference, a pointer at that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 50.34,
          "en": "and therefore I'll name it ComponentRef in this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.34,
          "end": 53.34,
          "en": "Now we can interact with that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.34,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "We can use our ComponentRef here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 58.71,
          "en": "and this has a instance property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "which gives us access to the concrete instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 63.633,
          "en": "of this component that was created here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "Now this instance should have the properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 70.86,
          "en": "we added to our component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 73.23,
          "en": "So it should have a message and a closed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "because both here are properties of the Alert Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "And indeed, if we type a dot here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 81.3,
          "en": "you see close and message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.3,
          "end": 84,
          "en": "So now we can set message here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "equal to the message we're getting as a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 89.94,
          "en": "and this should ensure that the message is displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.94,
          "end": 93.36,
          "en": "Let's give this a try, let's save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.36,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "and try logging in with wrong credentials again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 98.4,
          "en": "And indeed here's our message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.4,
          "end": 99.75,
          "en": "Well, that's great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.75,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "Now for closing, we simply manually have to listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "to our close event here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 109.83,
          "en": "And for that, I again reach out to the instance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.83,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "and then to close...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "And remember that close in the end here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "is just an EventEmitter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 117.9,
          "en": "Now, you learn that you should use EventEmitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.9,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "basically only here, when it's decorated with @Output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 125.04,
          "en": "And whenever you manually subscribe to something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 126.69,
          "en": "you would want to use a subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.69,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "Here is basically the only exception to that rule.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 132.3,
          "en": "Since this is a component where we have @Output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "because we could use this component by selector as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 138.06,
          "en": "we have an EventEmitter and yet here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.06,
          "end": 141.273,
          "en": "I manually want to subscribe and here, this is okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.01,
          "end": 145.77,
          "en": "So here we subscribe to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.77,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "and whenever this fires will run this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 151.59,
          "en": "which I pass to subscribe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "and in there we essentially wanna clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 157.59300000000002,
          "en": "that component reference, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 161.1,
          "en": "Therefore, let's first of all store the subscription",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.1,
          "end": 163.323,
          "en": "because we should manage this manually here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.18,
          "end": 169.89,
          "en": "Private closeSub, which is of type subscription",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.89,
          "end": 172.203,
          "en": "which is imported from RXJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.483,
          "end": 174.84,
          "en": "because the EventEmitter from Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 176.4,
          "en": "is based on the subject actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "and therefore it has the same type of subscription.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 181.527,
          "en": "So here, I'll store this, closeSub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "And now when we do close it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 188.88,
          "en": "so when we make it into this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.88,
          "end": 193.83,
          "en": "we can call this closeSub, unsubscribe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.83,
          "end": 195.72,
          "en": "because I wanna clear the subscription",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.72,
          "end": 198.543,
          "en": "because I know that this component will be removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.19,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "And of course to remove the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "we use our hostViewContainerRef,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.48,
          "en": "and there we can call clear again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 210.15,
          "en": "to clear all content that was rendered there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.15,
          "end": 211.413,
          "en": "Let's give this a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "Click on the backdrop and it's gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 219.813,
          "en": "Let's try this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 222.87,
          "en": "Let's all inspect it in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 224.07,
          "en": "Here we can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.07,
          "end": 227.01,
          "en": "it is being rendered the app alert component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.01,
          "end": 230.19,
          "en": "If I click close, that indeed is removed from the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 231.24,
          "en": "So this works...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 234.63,
          "en": "One tiny piece of extra cleanup I wanna do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.63,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "is I also wanna clear that subscription here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 239.4,
          "en": "if we get rid of the AuthComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 239.4,
          "end": 241.41,
          "en": "because if that AuthComponent is removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.41,
          "end": 243.79,
          "en": "we also don't wanna have the old subscriptions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 245.28,
          "end": 246.66,
          "en": "sit around anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.66,
          "end": 251.66,
          "en": "So, I will implement OnDestroy here into the AuthComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.37,
          "end": 257.52,
          "en": "OnDestroy, of course is imported from @Angular/core,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.52,
          "end": 260.22,
          "en": "and with OnDestroy imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.22,
          "end": 262.83,
          "en": "here we have to add our NG OnDestroy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.83,
          "end": 264.6,
          "en": "And there, I wanna check if we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.6,
          "end": 267.78,
          "en": "an active close subscription, and if we do have one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.78,
          "end": 270.42,
          "en": "because we only have one if we showed that error alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.42,
          "end": 273.06,
          "en": "therefore we need to check for the existence of this first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.06,
          "end": 276.81,
          "en": "If we do have one, then I wanna unsubscribe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.81,
          "end": 281.427,
          "en": "And now this ensures that when we do see that error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 283.08,
          "end": 285.63,
          "en": "and we somehow would get rid of that AuthComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 285.63,
          "end": 287.52,
          "en": "we have no real way, but still,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.52,
          "end": 292.23,
          "en": "then we would not have that ongoing subscription anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 292.23,
          "end": 295.08,
          "en": "So with that, now I can close this and I'll try again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.08,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "with correct credentials and this now looks way better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 302.07,
          "en": "So, this is how you can dynamically create a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 302.07,
          "end": 303.513,
          "en": "from Inside Code.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
